# Design system

- Raw pixel values live only in `lib/app/theme/app_tokens.dart` (`AppSpacing`, `AppSize`, `AppRadius`, `AppColors`, `AppLayout`).
- Widgets use tokens, not literals, for padding, gaps, icon size, corner radius, and brand/status colors.
- Typography and Material colors: `Theme.of(context).textTheme` and `colorScheme`, not ad-hoc `TextStyle(fontSize: 16)`.
- Theme assembly: `AppTheme` in `app_theme.dart`; do not duplicate token values in feature code.

```dart
// BAD
Container(width: 40, height: 40)
padding: EdgeInsets.all(16)
Icon(Icons.error, size: 40)

// GOOD — app_shell.dart, home_page.dart
width: AppSize.logo, height: AppSize.logo
padding: EdgeInsets.all(AppSpacing.md)
Icon(Icons.error_outline, size: AppSize.iconXxl)
```

- Product constants (segment minutes, byte estimates): `core/constants/`, not `AppSpacing`.